ome and preparing for surgery to repair her hand injury. Despite the painful ordeal, Claire still dreams of becoming a marine biologist. Her family shares the story to raise awareness and encourage water safety precautions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-13-year-old-texas-girl-was-bitten-by-a-barracuda-in-turks-and-caicos-after-a-tourniquet-and-tendon-damage-she-still-plans-to-become-a-marine-biologist/articleshow/132709213.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-13-year-old-texas-girl-was-bitten-by-a-barracuda-in-turks-and-caicos-after-a-tourniquet-and-tendon-damage-she-still-plans-to-become-a-marine-biologist/articleshow/132709213.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T16:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132710754,imgsize-167568.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Cambridge study shows that just 10 minutes surrounded by trees and birdsong can significantly improve mood and psychological well-being]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132710541.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-cambridge-study-shows-that-just-10-minutes-surrounded-by-trees-and-birdsong-can-significantly-improve-mood-and-psychological-well-being/articleshow/132710541.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-cambridge-study-shows-that-just-10-minutes-surrounded-by-trees-and-birdsong-can-significantly-improve-mood-and-psychological-well-being/articleshow/132710541.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132