 apartment building to save a four-year-old boy hanging from a fourth-floor balcony, earning the nickname 'Spider-Man of Paris']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132706960.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Mamadou Gassama, an African migrant, rescued a child hanging from a Paris balcony.  His brave actions led to him being honoured by the French president.  Gassama received French citizenship and an internship with firefighters. This incident brought Gassama international recognition and a new life.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2018-an-undocumented-migrant-scaled-a-paris-apartment-building-to-save-a-four-year-old-boy-hanging-from-a-fourth-floor-balcony-earning-the-nickname-spider-man-of-paris/articleshow/132706960.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2018-an-undocumented-migrant-scaled-a-paris-apartment-building-to-save-a-four-year-old-boy-hanging-from-a-fourth-floor-balcony-earning-the-nickname-spider-man-of-paris/articleshow/132706960.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T16:32:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132707456,imgsize-114741.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[ Oregon engineer spent $100,000 on a retired Boeing 727 and turned it into a home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132705877.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1999-an-oregon-engineer-spent-100000-on-a-retired-boeing-727-and-turned-it-into-a-home-deep-in-the-forest/articleshow/132705877.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1999-an-ore